subckt rf_tr_switch (VSS tx ant rx ctx crx)
M1 (ant net10 tx net6) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=10 nf=1 m=10
M2 (tx net1 net7 net12) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=10 nf=1 m=2
M3 (net7 net4 VSS net11) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=10 nf=1 m=2
M4 (net5 net8 ant net2) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=10 nf=1 m=20
M5 (rx net3 net5 net0) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=10 nf=1 m=20
M6 (rx net9 VSS VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=10 nf=1 m=4
RB1 (net6 VSS) resistor r=10k
RB2 (VSS net12) resistor r=10k
RB3 (VSS net11) resistor r=10k
RB4 (net2 VSS) resistor r=10k
RB5 (net0 VSS) resistor r=10k
RG1 (ctx net10) resistor r=10k
RG2 (net1 crx) resistor r=10k
RG3 (net4 crx) resistor r=10k
RG4 (crx net8) resistor r=10k
RG5 (crx net3) resistor r=10k
RG6 (ctx net9) resistor r=10k
